{"4152400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outpost Market Simulator", "steam_appid": 4152400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/6f2d095355a8316fae4bd228dbbfccf4.avif?t=1770766780\" width=1080 height=1920 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Outpost Market Simulator</i>, a first-person market simulator where economic strategy and hardcore survival collide. Your mission: build a fortified outpost from nothing, create a thriving trade hub, and defend it every single night against the creatures that want to tear it all down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fortress From Scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your build tool and design your outpost tile-by-tile. Every wall, every floor, every turret location is your decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage a Dynamic Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just a survivor; you're a CEO. Stock your shelves with goods, and NPC customers will automatically visit your outpost to shop. But be smart they'll only buy what they want, and they know when a price is too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive at Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun goes down, the fight begins. Grab your weapons and defend your base in intense, first-person shooter combat. The richer you get, the harder they'll try to take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Like a Tycoon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to engineer the defence. Place walls, turrets, barbed wires, and explosive traps. Funnel the zombies through a deadly maze of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Outpost Market Simulator</i>, a first-person market simulator where economic strategy and hardcore survival collide. Your mission: build a fortified outpost from nothing, create a thriving trade hub, and defend it every single night against the creatures that want to tear it all down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fortress From Scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your build tool and design your outpost tile-by-tile. Every wall, every floor, every turret location is your decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/d535708f7641fcc628d1ab0588e8b5bb.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage a Dynamic Market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just a survivor; you're a CEO. Stock your shelves with goods, and NPC customers will automatically visit your outpost to shop. But be smart they'll only buy what they want, and they know when a price is too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c289c0462670d97c17280e1ffcbafaf7.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive at Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sun goes down, the fight begins. Grab your weapons and defend your base in intense, first-person shooter combat. The richer you get, the harder they'll try to take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/58052b49c5c8f9d7789418437e352f9e.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Like a Tycoon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to engineer the defence. Place walls, turrets, barbed wires, and explosive traps. Funnel the zombies through a deadly maze of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.poster.avif?t=1770766780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.webm?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/extras/c9f023dbe99e6ceac856835d74e4fd4a.mp4?t=1770766780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Outpost Market Simulator is a 1–6 player co-op game. Build your market, order loot, craft items, sell them, research new tech, and build defenses to survive the nightly zombie attacks", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/8f42e157071469bd7cea6ccbabf10a31e8dd42b5/header.jpg?t=1770766780", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/64bbd2735169ceb5ca77ff2b5c48a27f2ae7d3cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770766780", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152400/64bbd2735169ceb5ca77ff2b5c48a27f2ae7d3cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770766780", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 (4GB) or NVIDIA GeForce GTX 10